        "v": "Discovery is the phase before design. It answers two questions: does generative AI belong in this solution, and what would \"done\" look like? AWS calls this the scoping phase and puts its focus on \"the relevance of generative AI in solving the problem.\" [3] Everything downstream (model choice, prompts, evals, SLOs) depends on the answers, so getting them in writing is the first deliverable."
