        "v": "Anthropic separates these forms by who controls the flow of work. Workflows are \"systems where LLMs and tools are orchestrated through predefined code paths.\" Agents are \"systems where LLMs dynamically direct their own processes and tool usage.\" [2] The decision belongs in discovery because it drives cost, latency, and predictability, and because stakeholders often use the word \"agent\" for anything automated."
