        "t": "text",
        "v": "When there are many candidate use cases, plot each on value against feasibility. The four quadrants are quick wins (high value, high feasibility), big bets (high value, low feasibility), fill-ins (low value, high feasibility), and traps (low value, low feasibility). [5] The quadrant matters less than the discipline of scoring both axes with evidence."
