        "v": " A pilot gate that closes properly: 92% on the 400-case golden set, p95 at 6.2 seconds, cost per case $0.031 projecting to $18,600 a month at forecast volume, escalation rate 7% needing 1.4 reviewer FTE. The sponsor approves the cost and staffing before build continues, rather than discovering both at launch."
